msgstr "WP Pass Captain: Credentials (e.g. Stripe, PayPal) are encrypted with a key derived from the WordPress salts. Recommended: define your own key as the constant WPCAP_SECRETS_KEY in wp-config.php (at least 32 random characters) – otherwise the credentials become unreadable when the salts are renewed."

